WEBVTT

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:02.720
Thank you.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:36.790
You're a little piccaninny, you're gonna kill yourself flying like that.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:37.730
Yes, you are.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:53.820
You're better.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:08.990
