00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:12.800
Didn't say nothing.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.340
Didn't you?

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.320
Mr. David Burke.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:17.890
607, sir.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:30.530
