00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:31.960
Six.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.040
You hear that wind?

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.400
Man, I'm gonna get myself grounded out of the Air Force.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.800
That's what I'm gonna do.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:45.430
Ain't gonna fly this kind of crate anymore.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.460
Can you blame me?

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.330
I'm Slater, right on.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:35.410
All right there, Uly. Come in. Come in.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.600
Here, let me help you off with your things.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.020
You're such a big old dog in New York.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.180
I never had a wife.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.100
Right on the button. That's what I'm looking for, Slater.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.020
Someone serious with a head for business.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.780
All right here. Come on. Over here. Here. Up.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.720
Whiskey? I don't mind.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:04:59.620
Straighter with water. With water.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.650
I got ice. You want ice?

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:02.810
No, just water.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.340
Make yourself comfortable, Slater. We've got to talk.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:10.670
Have you?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.400
You've got a whole heap of it.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.720
Nice to be able to afford a little space inside, too.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:22.250
But we call this dump home, don't we, old boy?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:23.610
Not bad.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.900
Nice to our mutual benefit. May it be considerable.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.540
I guess you know all you had to know about me, Slater.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:34.880
I know something.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.330
All right, you tell me what you know. Go on.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.090
