00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.820
I know you were on a police force.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:52.740
You had a session with the state crime committee, and you got a year for contempt.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.390
Because I wouldn't talk.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.560
