00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:14.780
Two stretches, one for assault with a deadly weapon, one for manslaughter.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.540
Every time you get a decent job, you'll manage to...

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:17.960
Cock it off.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.280
So big about you, Burke.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.620
Come, you make so much noise.

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.980
You've been sniffing around trying to find a hole in the fence just like...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.760
everybody else. I made you so big

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.800
you can call me up to this dump and shoot

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.860
up your mouth. I got an idea, that's

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.020
why, Slater. How would you like to pick up $50,000

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.700
all in small bills just

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:41.300
for yourself?

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:04.240
No, when? Sure, that's fine.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:11.680
I do.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.020
Just walk into a bank and take it.

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.360
