00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.610
I'd want a big Joe with more decorations than Dillinger.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.450
I want a safe thing.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.620
A man who needs some money to send himself up.

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:35.970
